I reach the office.
My clothes are a little wet, because it is raining hard outside.
Rohan, Priya, and my manager Suresh meet me at the door.
They smile looking at me.
They take me straight to the breakroom.
A big chocolate cake is placed on a table there.
They all say together, "Happy birthday, Maya!"
I am very surprised seeing this surprise.
Rohan says, "Maya, I ordered this cake yesterday."
Priya laughs and says, "And even in this bad weather, it has finally arrived!"
I ask them, "Did you guys do all this for me?"
Suresh says, "Yes Maya, you started work here in January."
"And today you have celebrated your first birthday with us!"
I blow out the candle and cut the cake.
Everyone claps happily.
I give the first piece of cake to Suresh.
I say, "Suresh, please take it."
After this I give cake to Rohan and Priya too.
We all eat the cake together with enjoyment.
I have liked this office surprise very much.
